    "title": "Variabili autoassegnate",
    "descriptionContent": "Impara a cambiare rapidamente i valori delle variabili.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17311,
        "title": "Esercizi",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146640,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Impariamo un nuovo concetto che spiega come le variabili tengono traccia di elementi come l'aggiunta o la perdita di punti in un gioco.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   button {&#xA;    background-color: darkBlue;&#xA;    border: none;&#xA;    border-radius: 8px;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    text-decoration: none;&#xA;    display: inline-block;&#xA;    font-size: 14px;&#xA;    padding: 6px 12px;&#xA;    margin: 0 12px 0 0;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Score: &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;amount&quot;&gt;15&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;add()&quot;&gt;Gain +1&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;remove()&quot;&gt;Lose -1&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let score = 15;&#xA;   let amountCounter = document.getElementById(&quot;amount&quot;);&#xA;   &#xA;   function add() {&#xA;    score += 1;&#xA;    amountCounter.innerHTML = score;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   function remove() {&#xA;    score -= 1;&#xA;    amountCounter.innerHTML = score;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146641,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando creiamo una variabile, le <strong>assegniamo</strong> un valore, come assegnare <code>3</code> a <code>score</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146642,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>L'autoassegnazione</strong> si verifica quando impostiamo una variabile sul proprio valore. Ad esempio, possiamo impostare <code>playerHealth</code> sul valore <code>3</code> con <code>playerHealth = playerHealth</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerHealth = playerHealth;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>playerHealth</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e poi <code>playerHealth</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146643,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dato che possiamo riassegnare le variabili a se stesse, possiamo aumentare o diminuire le variabili numeriche. Prova ad aumentare <code>playerHealth</code> di 1.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerHealth = playerHealth + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3 + 1\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"53\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>playerHealth + 1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146644,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le variabili autoassegnate ci permettono di tenere traccia dei dati che cambiano nel tempo. Per esempio, un giocatore potrebbe recuperare <code>2</code> punti salute e poi subire <code>1</code> danno.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"86\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerHealth = playerHealth + \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerHealth = playerHealth - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>2</code>, seguito da <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146645,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le variabili impostate su stringhe funzionano allo stesso modo. Prova a impostare <code>hudText</code> su <code>hudText + \" Level 2\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"79\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hudText = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Now playing:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hudText = hudText + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Level 1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hudText = hudText + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Level 2&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hudText);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>hudText</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146646,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il valore assegnato alla variabile <code>enemySpeed</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemySpeed = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>enemySpeed</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146647,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemySpeed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemySpeed = enemySpeed;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemySpeed);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>100</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146648,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemySpeed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemySpeed = enemySpeed + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemySpeed);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>101</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>100</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>101</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146649,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché l'autoassegnazione è un concetto di programmazione così potente?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Perché ci permette di tenere traccia dei dati che cambiano nel tempo</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Perché ci aiuta a creare confronti</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Perché ci permette di tenere traccia dei dati che cambiano nel tempo.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146650,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerName = playerName + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Nova&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerName);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Ranger Nova</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Nova Ranger</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Ranger Nova</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 146651,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assegna <code>15</code> alla variabile <code>score</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"16\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>15</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 146652,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assegna un valore a <code>coins</code> in modo che nella console venga visualizzato <code>5</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"7\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coins = number;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(coins);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>number</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 146653,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi cinque al valore della variabile <code>ammo</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"30\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ammo = \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ammo = ammo + \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(ammo);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>ammo + 5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 146654,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sottrai uno dal valore della variabile <code>lives</code>, poi aggiungi quattro.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lives = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lives = lives - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lives = lives + \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(lives);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>-</code>, seguito da <code>1</code> e poi <code>+</code>, <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 146655,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza <code>Pixel Knight</code> nella console codificando <code>characterName</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"58\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" characterName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Pixel&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"characterName = characterName + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(characterName);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>characterName</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
